                                                                               
 Usage: xrpl-camp certificate [OPTIONS]                                        
                                                                               
 Generate a completion certificate and proof pack (--format text adds a .txt   
 keepsake).                                                                    
                                                                               
┌─ Options ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ --out            <str>   Folder to write the files into (default: this      │
│                          directory)                                         │
│ --format         <str>   Certificate format: json (default) or text (also   │
│                          writes xrpl_camp_certificate.txt)                  │
│                          [default: json]                                    │
│ --dry-run        <bool>  Show what would be sealed without writing any      │
│                          files                                              │
│ --help           <bool>  Show this message and exit.                        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

